  "title": "Caroline&#39;s Chocolate Fudge Frosting",
  "description": "This chocolate fudge frosting is easy to make with just five ingredients. Use it on cakes or cupcakes — it&#39;s so much better than those store-bought tubs!",
  "authors": [
